WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.268
-The president called

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:04.970
the charges against him
"impeachment lite,"

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.239
as one of his main conspiracy
theories about the FBI

00:00:07.239 --> 00:00:08.574
was officially debunked.

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:10.710
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.747
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:17.483
Yesterday, the House unveiled
articles of impeachment

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.319
against a president for only
the fourth time in history.

00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:22.355
Now, if you were worried about
getting fired

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.357
and you were trying to prove
that you were,

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:25.758
in fact, qualified for your job,

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:27.127
you might decide
to try to behave

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:28.528
like a normal, sane person.

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:31.530
Instead, Trump decided to go
to Pennsylvania last night

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.467
for one of his deranged rallies
and do his usual routine

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.968
of slurring like a lunatic

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.938
while throwing in
some of his trademark sexism.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:41.941
-The president of Ukraine
repeatedly declared

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.510
that there was no pressure,
but he didn't want to say that.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:48.114
We said, "Say it. Say it,
you crooked bastard. Say it."

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.183
You'd have windmills
all over the place

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:51.584
if you had crooked Hillary.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.386
They'd be knocking out
those birds left and right.

00:00:54.386 --> 00:00:58.224
Those windmills,
"Wah, wah, wah."

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:01.161
Beto. Beto.
[ Rally audience booing ]

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:03.229
Remember?

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:06.465
So, he wanted to get rid
of religion, the bible.

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:09.469
Crazy Elizabeth Warren --
I give her credit.

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:10.870
I thought she was left for.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:14.841
I mean, there were, like,
just little embers,

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:16.375
and then she rose.

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.511
She rose and she became strong.

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:22.014
But then she opened that fresh
mouth of hers, and it stopped.

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:24.584
-"She opened her fresh mouth"?

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.319
You sound like the headmaster

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:30.389
of a private school
called St. Misogynist Academy.

00:01:30.389 --> 00:01:32.425
Elizabeth Warren
has detailed plans

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:33.893
for things people
actually care about

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.861
like corruption and equality
and climate change.

00:01:35.861 --> 00:01:40.433
Your energy plan is that
windmills sound like "wah, wah.

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.402
Wah."

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.671
Trump's obviously rattled by the
fact that he's about to become

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:46.706
the third president ever
in history to be impeached.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.174
No matter what happens next,

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.009
Trump's name will be
emblazoned in history

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.244
as one of only three presidents
to be impeached,

00:01:52.244 --> 00:01:53.579
and that will follow him
forever.

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:55.215
They're gonna have to
put an asterisk

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:56.950
next to Trump's name
on his building

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.386
with a footnote below it
that says "impeached."

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:03.289
Now...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:06.692
...House Democrats
decided to exercise restraint

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:09.228
and file only two articles
of impeachment against Trump

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:11.597
despite the fact that they
could've filed many more.

00:02:11.597 --> 00:02:14.801
I mean, this guy obstructed
justice, solicited a bribe,

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.437
and was literally identified
as Individual One

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:19.806
in a court filing
involving an illegal scheme

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.641
to pay hush money
to cover up an affair,

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.676
and we know Individual One
was Trump

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:26.478
because the document also said,
"Individual One began

00:02:26.478 --> 00:02:28.381
an ultimately successful
campaign

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.416
for president
of the United States."

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:31.751
That was in a court filing.

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.286
I mean, think about
how crazy that is.

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:34.787
That's never happened before.

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:37.490
It's not like Abraham Lincoln
was ever named in an indictment

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.893
as Honest Man in Very Large Hat
Number One.

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:43.396
And yet Trump yesterday
actually taunted Democrats

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:46.232
for not filing
even more charges against him

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:49.135
by mocking how limited the
articles of impeachment were.

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:52.438
-You saw their so called
articles of impeachment today.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:57.010
People are saying, "They're not
even a crime. What happened?

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.178
All of these horrible things.
Remember?

00:02:59.178 --> 00:03:03.816
Bribery, and this and that.
Where are they?"

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:06.819
They send these two things.
They're not even a crime.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:10.523
This is the lightest,
weakest impeachment.

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:12.792
You know, our country's had
actually many impeachments.

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:16.328
You call judges and lots
of other -- many impeachments.

00:03:16.328 --> 00:03:17.830
But it was on today.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.167
Everybody says,
"This is impeachment lite."

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:25.471
This is the lightest impeachment

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:28.774
in the history of our country
by far.

00:03:28.774 --> 00:03:32.411
-You're either impeached
or your not.

00:03:32.411 --> 00:03:34.948
There's no light version.

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:38.651
Trump's like a drunk guy at
a bar on his sixth beer going,

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:40.118
"It's impeachment lite.

00:03:40.118 --> 00:03:43.522
Now give me my keys!"

00:03:43.522 --> 00:03:47.359
Trump needs --
he desperately needs

00:03:47.359 --> 00:03:50.863
these group therapy sessions
with his fawning admirers

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:52.764
so he could lie to himself
and soothe his ego.

00:03:52.764 --> 00:03:55.000
For example, he also made this
ludicrous statement about

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.870
how the world has reacted
to his presidency.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.806
-This country is so respected,

00:04:00.806 --> 00:04:04.143
and we were not respected
four years ago.

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:06.112
We were laughed at.

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.680
-Dude,
it was literally last week

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.582
that a bunch of world leaders
were caught laughing at you

00:04:10.582 --> 00:04:13.252
in a group chat
during the NATO summit,

00:04:13.252 --> 00:04:14.987
including your buddy
Boris Johnson.

00:04:14.987 --> 00:04:17.089
And if you're getting laughed at
by this guy,

00:04:17.089 --> 00:04:19.125
you know you are an idiot.

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:22.161
Boris Johnson would be
the world's Donald Trump

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:25.564
if there wasn't already
an actual Donald Trump.

00:04:25.564 --> 00:04:29.001
Boris Johnson must be
so happy Donald Trump exists.

00:04:29.001 --> 00:04:30.469
It's like in middle school

00:04:30.469 --> 00:04:34.006
when the chess nerd finds out
the school has a LARPing nerd.

00:04:34.006 --> 00:04:36.608
He's like, "I'm off the hook!"

00:04:36.608 --> 00:04:38.611
In fact, today in the UK,

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:40.479
Johnson dodged questions
from reporters

00:04:40.479 --> 00:04:42.915
during a campaign stop
at a dairy farm

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:45.884
by literally
hiding in a freezer.

00:04:45.884 --> 00:04:49.154
-Mr. Johnson,
we only have five minutes.

00:04:49.154 --> 00:04:50.656
Could you talk to us?

00:04:50.656 --> 00:04:53.025
-I'll be with you in a second.
I'll be with you in a second.

00:04:53.025 --> 00:04:55.561
-I have an ear piece here
in my hand ready to go.

00:04:58.697 --> 00:05:02.835
Right. He's been taken inside
into the freezer.

00:05:02.835 --> 00:05:05.070
-He hid in the freezer.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.172
Although, it's hard to tell
with him,

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:07.473
because he always looks like

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:09.775
he was just locked in a freezer.

00:05:09.775 --> 00:05:13.412
I mean, if you put Trump's hair
on Jack from the "Shining,"

00:05:13.412 --> 00:05:15.013
you'd get Boris Johnson.

00:05:15.013 --> 00:05:17.049
That is...how that looks.

00:05:17.049 --> 00:05:20.285
So, as usual, Trump's rally was
totally detached from reality.

00:05:20.285 --> 00:05:22.922
In fact, Trump went to
such lengths to soothe his ego

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:25.290
in the face of
a historic political reckoning

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.560
that at one point, he literally
gave himself credit

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.328
for saving people's marriages

00:05:29.328 --> 00:05:30.996
with an obviously
made-up story

00:05:30.996 --> 00:05:34.233
about how happy people are
about their 401(k)s.

00:05:34.233 --> 00:05:38.037
-I have so many people that come
up to me, "Thank you, sir.

00:05:38.037 --> 00:05:39.672
My wife is so in love with me

00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:44.076
because I went up 79%
in the 401(k).

00:05:44.076 --> 00:05:45.210
She thinks I'm a genius.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:47.413
She always thought
I was a total stiff --

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:50.249
a dumb, stupid dope.

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:53.586
Now she thinks
I'm a financial genius, sir."

00:05:53.586 --> 00:05:56.455
-First of all, if your spouse
thought you were a dumb,

00:05:56.455 --> 00:05:59.258
stupid dope
until your 401(k) went up,

00:05:59.258 --> 00:06:02.328
your marriage
still has problems.

00:06:02.328 --> 00:06:04.129
I do wonder
where Trump got the idea

00:06:04.129 --> 00:06:05.465
that wives
only love their husbands

00:06:05.465 --> 00:06:06.465
if they have a lot of money.

00:06:06.465 --> 00:06:09.168
I guess we'll never know.

00:06:09.168 --> 00:06:10.403
Now, you might recall that

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:12.271
since virtually the start
of his presidency

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:14.574
Trump has harbored
a deranged conspiracy theory

00:06:14.574 --> 00:06:18.711
that there was a secret cell of
treasonous deep-state saboteurs

00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:21.314
within the government
trying to take him down,

00:06:21.314 --> 00:06:22.482
you know, like an insane person.

00:06:22.482 --> 00:06:24.250
He's one step away from claiming

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:26.385
his aids are
actually secret lizard people,

00:06:26.385 --> 00:06:31.023
when we know for a fact
they're obvious lizard people.

00:06:31.023 --> 00:06:34.727
Why else would Stephen Miller's
eyes blink sideways?

00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:39.164
Trump has continued to repeat
this conspiracy theory

00:06:39.164 --> 00:06:40.733
even though
it's already been debunked,

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:43.669
including by an Inspector
General's report on Monday

00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:46.305
and by the Inspector General
himself at a hearing today.

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:47.573
Now, you might remember that

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:49.542
this whole insane
conspiracy theory started

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:51.344
when Trump tweeted this
out of nowhere

00:06:51.344 --> 00:06:52.945
a few months
into his presidency.

00:06:52.945 --> 00:06:54.680
"Terrible.
Just found out that Obama

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.214
had my wires tapped
in Trump Tower

00:06:56.214 --> 00:06:57.683
just before the victory,"

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:00.686
and then "How low has President
Obama gone to tap my phones

00:07:00.686 --> 00:07:02.688
during the very sacred
election process?

00:07:02.688 --> 00:07:05.891
This is Nixon Watergate --
bad or sick guy."

00:07:05.891 --> 00:07:08.794
That was March of 2017.

00:07:08.794 --> 00:07:10.095
Remember when we thought

00:07:10.095 --> 00:07:13.132
that was the craziest thing
a president ever said?

00:07:13.132 --> 00:07:15.200
We were so young.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.903
Also, I love Trump's
parentheticals --

00:07:16.903 --> 00:07:18.203
bad or sick guy.

00:07:18.203 --> 00:07:19.772
It's like
a choose-your-own adventure book

00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:21.207
for insane people.

00:07:21.207 --> 00:07:23.109
"If you think Obama was good,
turn to page 10.

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:24.677
If you think he was bad,
turn to page 27,

00:07:24.677 --> 00:07:25.945
and if you think he's sick,

00:07:25.945 --> 00:07:28.847
I'd like to offer you
Secretary of Agriculture."

00:07:28.847 --> 00:07:31.117
Trump's about to face
a historic political reckoning

00:07:31.117 --> 00:07:33.018
for a simple reason --
he abused his power,

00:07:33.018 --> 00:07:34.586
he tried to cover it up,
and he got caught.

00:07:34.586 --> 00:07:38.423
And now his only move is to spin
dark fantasies of subterfuge

00:07:38.423 --> 00:07:40.759
and paranoia to scare his base
and keep them in line.

00:07:40.759 --> 00:07:42.795
But sometimes
he even undercuts himself.

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:44.764
At the rally yesterday,
for example,

00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:46.398
he told his fawning admirers

00:07:46.398 --> 00:07:48.834
that Democrats were trying
to overthrow the government

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:50.836
simply by following
the impeachment procedures

00:07:50.836 --> 00:07:51.971
laid out in the Constitution.

00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:53.139
But in the next breath,

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:55.274
he told them
it wasn't that big of a deal.

00:07:55.274 --> 00:07:57.309
-The radical left Democrats

00:07:57.309 --> 00:08:00.312
and the failed
Washington establishment

00:08:00.312 --> 00:08:04.617
are trying to erase your votes,
nullify the election,

00:08:04.617 --> 00:08:06.652
and overthrow our Democracy.

00:08:06.652 --> 00:08:09.388
Not gonna happen.
Don't worry about it.

00:08:09.388 --> 00:08:11.290
I wouldn't lose too much sleep
over it.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.058
-If we're not
supposed to worry about it,

00:08:13.058 --> 00:08:14.559
why are you telling us?

00:08:14.559 --> 00:08:18.030
He's like a dad at a campfire
who realizes his spooky stories

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.831
are scaring the kids,
so he pulls back.

00:08:19.831 --> 00:08:21.734
"They say
these woods are haunted

00:08:21.734 --> 00:08:23.502
by a killer in a hockey mask

00:08:23.502 --> 00:08:25.470
who waits for little children
to go to bed

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:26.772
so he can chop up their bodies,

00:08:26.772 --> 00:08:28.440
but now that I think about it,

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.643
he was arrested and he's in
prison, so you know, it's fine.

00:08:31.643 --> 00:08:33.645
Just forget
Daddy said that part.

00:08:33.645 --> 00:08:36.215
Don't tell Mommy
I said that part."

00:08:36.215 --> 00:08:38.684
Turns out, of course, that the
conspiracy theory was insane

00:08:38.684 --> 00:08:40.786
and on Monday became official
when the Justice Department

00:08:40.786 --> 00:08:43.055
Inspector General
released his findings.

00:08:43.055 --> 00:08:44.624
It said that while there were
serious errors

00:08:44.624 --> 00:08:45.858
with parts of
the Russia investigation,

00:08:45.858 --> 00:08:47.359
it was both valid and justified.

00:08:47.359 --> 00:08:50.362
The only thing Republicans have
been able to hang their hat on

00:08:50.362 --> 00:08:53.465
is the fact that two FBI agents
sent text messages to each other

00:08:53.465 --> 00:08:55.668
disparaging Trump,
even though there were also

00:08:55.668 --> 00:08:58.904
FBI employees who sent pro-Trump
and anti-Hillary messages,

00:08:58.904 --> 00:09:01.606
and yet at the hearing today,
GOP Senator Lindsey Graham

00:09:01.606 --> 00:09:04.242
selectively read the anti-Trump
messages out loud

00:09:04.242 --> 00:09:05.811
for everyone to hear.

00:09:05.811 --> 00:09:07.746
-February 12, 2016.

00:09:07.746 --> 00:09:11.483
"Oh, he's" -- Trump --
"abysmal."

00:09:11.483 --> 00:09:13.352
March 3, 2016.

00:09:13.352 --> 00:09:17.557
Page, "God,
Trump is a loathsome human."

00:09:17.557 --> 00:09:21.326
Strzok, "Oh, my God.
He's an idiot."

00:09:21.326 --> 00:09:23.762
March 16, 2016.

00:09:23.762 --> 00:09:25.430
"I cannot believe Donald Trump

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:28.968
is likely to be actual serious
candidate for President."

00:09:28.968 --> 00:09:32.705
July 16th. We're getting closer
to when this thing opens.

00:09:32.705 --> 00:09:36.842
"And, wow, Donald Trump
is an enormous douche."

00:09:36.842 --> 00:09:38.510
Again, a lot of people
agree with them.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.379
-Those messages
don't prove anything.

00:09:40.379 --> 00:09:41.880
You can't go
anywhere in the world

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.649
without hearing
opinions about Trump.

00:09:43.649 --> 00:09:47.119
I'm pretty sure there are people
stranded on deserted islands

00:09:47.119 --> 00:09:49.621
in the Bermuda Triangle putting
rocks together that say

00:09:49.621 --> 00:09:52.024
"Trump is a douche."

00:09:52.024 --> 00:09:54.360
I mean, think about weak
the president's position is.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.328
He's been reduced to arguing
that being impeached

00:09:56.328 --> 00:09:58.563
isn't that bad
because it's impeachment lite,

00:09:58.563 --> 00:10:00.031
and now
his key conspiracy
theory

00:10:00.031 --> 00:10:01.534
claiming
the whole thing was a hoax

00:10:01.534 --> 00:10:02.934
has been officially debunked

00:10:02.934 --> 00:10:05.270
by the Justice Department
Inspector General.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.606
At this point, the only way
things could get worse for Trump

00:10:07.606 --> 00:10:09.875
is if the House passed a third
article of impeachment

00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:12.077
calling Trump...
-"An enormous douche."

00:10:12.077 --> 00:10:13.913
-This has been "A Closer Look."

